<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges down to 4.6448 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges down to 4.6448 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.6448 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6415 on June 9.</p>
<p>				   June 10    June 9</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.6448     4.6415</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   20,000     180,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 9520</p>
